; First Steps in Punjabi / ਪੰਜਾਬੀ (pa)
; MultiLang-ASM Kids
; ==========================================

ਭੇਜੋ box 10       ; Put 10 candies in the box
ਜੋੜੋ box 5        ; Get 5 more candies (15)
ਘਟਾਓ box 2        ; Eat 2 candies (13 left!)
ਸਿਸਟਮ_ਕਾਲ box         ; Show the final candy count!
